==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|sun|screen}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[topical]] product for the [[skin]] containing [[organic compound|organic compounds]] that [[absorb]], and/or [[titanium dioxide]] that [[reflect|reflects]] the sun's [[ultraviolet]] [[radiation]].

====Hyponyms====
* [[sunblock]]

